000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SURVVALID.
000300 AUTHOR. SURVDEMO.
000400*
000500* VALIDATE A SURVIVOR INCOME ENTITLEMENT FOR MONTHLY CALCULATION.
000600*
000700 DATA DIVISION.
000800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000900 01  WS-RELATIONSHIP              PIC X(3).
001000
001100 LINKAGE SECTION.
001200     COPY SURVVAL.
001300
001400 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING SURVIVOR-VALIDATION-AREA.
001500 MAIN-LOGIC.
001600     MOVE 'Y' TO SV-RESULT
001700     MOVE SPACES TO SV-REASON-CODE
001800     MOVE SV-RELATIONSHIP TO WS-RELATIONSHIP
001900
002000     EVALUATE TRUE
002100         WHEN SV-CLAIM-STATUS NOT = 'A'
002200             MOVE 'N' TO SV-RESULT
002300             MOVE 'C1' TO SV-REASON-CODE
002400         WHEN SV-BENEFICIARY-STATUS NOT = 'A'
002500             MOVE 'N' TO SV-RESULT
002600             MOVE 'B1' TO SV-REASON-CODE
002700         WHEN WS-RELATIONSHIP NOT = 'SPS'
002800          AND WS-RELATIONSHIP NOT = 'CHD'
002900          AND WS-RELATIONSHIP NOT = 'DEP'
003000             MOVE 'N' TO SV-RESULT
003100             MOVE 'R1' TO SV-REASON-CODE
003200         WHEN SV-BENEFIT-PCT <= ZERO
003300          OR SV-BENEFIT-PCT > 100
003400             MOVE 'N' TO SV-RESULT
003500             MOVE 'P1' TO SV-REASON-CODE
003600         WHEN SV-OFFSET-AMOUNT < ZERO
003700             MOVE 'N' TO SV-RESULT
003800             MOVE 'O1' TO SV-REASON-CODE
003900         WHEN SV-BASE-AMOUNT <= ZERO
004000             MOVE 'N' TO SV-RESULT
004100             MOVE 'A1' TO SV-REASON-CODE
004200         WHEN OTHER
004300             CONTINUE
004400     END-EVALUATE
004500
004600     GOBACK.
